{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="docs-container--standard" style="margin:0 auto; padding: var(--docs-space-6) var(--docs-space-4);">
  <span class="docs-eyebrow">Implementation · ISQ · Platform boundary</span>
  <h1>Storyline</h1>
  <p class="docs-lede">A controlled extension point, not a commitment to support every tool. Storyline guidance is added only where a recurring delivery need is proven.</p>

  <div class="docs-module">
    <h2>When Storyline is justified</h2>
    <p>Selective guidance where complex interaction or simulation is required — cases the Rise authoring environment cannot adequately express. No source material for this stream has been supplied yet; this page is a placeholder ready to accept content.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="docs-module">
    <h2>How it consumes shared foundations</h2>
    <p>In principle: the same colour roles, typography and spacing tokens as Rise and Connect &amp; Learn, applied through Storyline's own theme and slide-master mechanisms rather than a shared stylesheet. This has not been implemented or tested.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="docs-module">
    <h2>Boundaries</h2>
    <p>Not yet defined. Do not build a Storyline course against this page until interaction conventions, launch/completion behaviour and visual tokens have been confirmed and documented here.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
